10
00:54:26,666 --> 00:54:32,666
Carrie Pilby is a 2016 American comedy-drama film directed by Susan Johnson and written by Kara
Holden and Dean Craig, based on the best-selling novel of the same name by Caren Lissner.

11
00:59:53,333 --> 00:59:59,333
The film stars Bel Powley, Nathan Lane, Gabriel Byrne, Jason Ritter,
William Moseley, Vanessa Bayer, and Colin O'Donoghue.

12
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
Principal photography began on December 14, 2015, in New York City.

13
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
It was screened in the Special Presentations section at the
2016 Toronto International Film Festival.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
The film was given a limited release on March 31, 2017, before being
released through video on demand on April 4, 2017, by The Orchard.

15
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
It debuted on Netflix on September 5, 2017.

16
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The film explores themes of new york city, genius, dating, woman director.

17
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
